        "created_at": "2019-03-29T10:19:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I automatically thought of Scholar for this game as an out of turn play machine. Argent Adept is the king of out of turn plays, though Stuntman is a close second. Argent Adept plus Captain Cosmic can provide a ridiculous amount of out of turn plays.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
