      {
        "id": 226185,
        "name": "Chris Rudd",
        "username": "Chris_Rudd",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/8c91f0/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-13T19:05:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ok I think I've figured out the team for this</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>• La Comodora - Chasing herself</p>\n<p>• Dark Conductor Argent Adept - Drawn by the void, seeking perhaps a way to undo his corruption</p>\n<p>• K.N.Y.F.E: Rogue Agent - Casing fugitives, possibly looking to rebuild The Block the right way</p>\n<p>• Akash'Thria - Awoken by the violent rift, seeking vengance for the land and trying to heal the rift</p>\n<p>• Lifeline - Having forseen the end, and having seen firsthand how hard Earth was to destroy, now seeks to ally with them against The End</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And La Capitan on Challenge</p>\n<p>Much more interesting synergy without being overly powerful.&nbsp; You really feel the pressure early on, but if you can find the right combo you can flip the game in 2 turns.&nbsp; Plus it gets the INFINITE VOID combo, where you can get every environment out together, which is just fun.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Try it a couple times and let me know if you like it enough to help build a story that goes along with it</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:00:01.771Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 19065,
        "topic_slug": "one-shot-submission-a-salty-dog-chasing-her-tail",
