        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Ok I think I've figured out the team for this</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• La Comodora - Chasing herself</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• Dark Conductor Argent Adept - Drawn by the void, seeking perhaps a way to undo his corruption</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• K.N.Y.F.E: Rogue Agent - Casing fugitives, possibly looking to rebuild The Block the right way</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• Akash'Thria - Awoken by the violent rift, seeking vengance for the land and trying to heal the rift</p>\r\n\r\n<p>• Lifeline - Having forseen the end, and having seen firsthand how hard Earth was to destroy, now seeks to ally with them against The End</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And La Capitan on Challenge</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Much more interesting synergy without being overly powerful.&nbsp; You really feel the pressure early on, but if you can find the right combo you can flip the game in 2 turns.&nbsp; Plus it gets the INFINITE VOID combo, where you can get every environment out together, which is just fun.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Try it a couple times and let me know if you like it enough to help build a story that goes along with it</p>",
